  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432133,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's also a swimming pool inside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435633,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's why I say this is a comprehensive sports complex"
